1
00:00:00,238 --> 00:00:03,908
(Sheldon:)only my name is
on the cable bill?

2
00:00:03,908 --> 00:00:06,408
(Leonard:)Yeah.

3
00:00:06,411 --> 00:00:09,111
(Sheldon:)Good, good.

4
00:00:09,113 --> 00:00:11,013
(Sheldon:)And your name is
on the electric bill

5
00:00:11,015 --> 00:00:12,915
(Sheldon:)and mine isn't.

6
00:00:12,917 --> 00:00:14,287
(Sheldon:)And I'm okay with that.

7
00:00:14,285 --> 00:00:16,685
(Leonard:)Actually, your name is
on the electric bill.

8
00:00:16,688 --> 00:00:18,488
(Sheldon:)Oh, right.

9
00:00:20,424 --> 00:00:23,594
(Sheldon:)This is a disaster.

10
00:00:23,595 --> 00:00:27,025
(Leonard:)I don't even know what you're
talking about and I agree.

11
00:00:27,031 --> 00:00:30,631
(Sheldon:)Okay, I have
to tell you something,

12
00:00:30,635 --> 00:00:32,635
(Sheldon:)but you're not going to like it.

13
00:00:32,637 --> 00:00:34,067
(Leonard:)What's going on?

14
00:00:34,072 --> 00:00:36,702
(Sheldon:)An article was just published

15
00:00:36,708 --> 00:00:39,608
in Scientific American
about our theory.

16
00:00:39,611 --> 00:00:41,211
(Leonard:)Did they hate it?

17
00:00:41,212 --> 00:00:43,342
(Sheldon:)No. No, they loved it.

18
00:00:43,348 --> 00:00:45,878
(Sheldon:)They, uh, couldn't say enough
nice things about it.

19
00:00:45,883 --> 00:00:48,313
(Leonard:)So what's the problem?

20
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:52,890
You know how the PennySaver
only has my name...

21
00:00:52,890 --> 00:00:54,190
Sheldon!

22
00:00:54,192 --> 00:00:56,822
(Sheldon:)They didn't mention you
in the article.

23
00:00:56,828 --> 00:00:58,228
(Sheldon:)Only me.

